            "invisible": false,
            "solution": ""
          },
          {
            "x": 2.23463687150838,
            "y": 13.245033112582783,
            "width": 92.73743016759778,
            "height": 86.09271523178808,
            "action": {
              "library": "H5P.AdvancedText 1.1",
              "params": {
                "text": "<p><strong>Early Prodigy</strong><br />\nClara Schumann was born Clara Wieck in 1819 in Leipzig, Germany, and she emerged as a child prodigy in her musical career. Trained by her father, she started playing the piano at an early age and began performing publicly by the age of nine.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Marriage to Robert Schumann</strong><br />\nIn 1840, Clara married Robert Schumann, despite her father's objections. They shared a deep bond over music, inspiring each other's work. Clara was the foremost interpreter of her husband's compositions and worked tirelessly to promote them.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Performance and Teaching</strong><br />\nClara Schumann had a long and successful career as a concert pianist, which spanned over 60 years. She was one of the first pianists to perform from memory, setting a standard for concert performances. Later, she also devoted herself to teaching, influencing a new generation of musicians.</p>\n"
              },
              "metadata": {
                "contentType": "Text",
                "license": "U",
                "title": "Unbenannt: Text",
                "defaultLanguage": "en"
              },
              "subContentId": "53bc5361-5ce5-43a9-a00f-57bbceee9cd0"
            },
            "alwaysDisplayComments": false,
            "backgroundOpacity": 0,
            "displayAsButton": false,
            "buttonSize": "big",
            "goToSlideType": "specified",
            "invisible": false,
            "solution": ""
          }
        ],
        "slideBackgroundSelector": {}
      },
      {
        "elements": [
          {
            "x": 2.23463687150838,
            "y": 4.415011037527593,
            "width": 37.98882681564246,
            "height": 8.830022075055187,
            "action": {
              "library": "H5P.AdvancedText 1.1",
              "params": {
                "text": "<p><span style=\"font-size:1.5em;\"><strong>INFORMATION TEXT (Part 2)</strong></span></p>\n"
              },
              "metadata": {
                "contentType": "Text",
                "license": "U",
                "title": "Unbenannt: Text",
                "defaultLanguage": "en"
              },
              "subContentId": "55aaf4d3-f7e3-4a3e-9196-01a6f7474f94"
            },
            "alwaysDisplayComments": false,
            "backgroundOpacity": 0,
            "displayAsButton": false,
            "buttonSize": "big",
            "goToSlideType": "specified",
            "invisible": false,
            "solution": ""
          },
          {
            "x": 2.23463687150838,
            "y": 13.245033112582782,
            "width": 92.73743016759778,
            "height": 86.09271523178808,
            "action": {
              "library": "H5P.AdvancedText 1.1",
              "params": {
                "text": "<p><strong>Composition and Repertoire</strong><br />\nAs a composer, Clara wrote piano pieces, chamber music, songs, and concertos, although she composed less after her marriage. Her works were known for their lyrical quality and romantic expressiveness.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Life After Robert</strong><br />\nAfter Robert Schumann's death in 1856, Clara continued her concert career to support her family. She became the principal breadwinner, touring extensively while also upholding Robert's musical legacy.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Impact on Music</strong><br />\nClara Schumann was not only a performer but also contributed to the development of the Romantic piano repertoire. Her editions and arrangements helped to shape the performance practices of the 19th-century piano music.</p>\n"
              },
              "metadata": {
                "contentType": "Text",
                "license": "U",
                "title": "Unbenannt: Text",
                "defaultLanguage": "en"
              },
              "subContentId": "3b13867b-feab-4e2e-bfa2-fcc82e4dbff1"
            },
            "alwaysDisplayComments": false,
            "backgroundOpacity": 0,
            "displayAsButton": false,
            "buttonSize": "big",
            "goToSlideType": "specified",
            "invisible": false,
            "solution": ""
          }
